  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you join any public instance of a world that have a lot of pickups you most likely will see all objects messing up because most of player doesn't care about order in the room and forget about objects state right after they used it. That means you should always go to the new instance and can not just join public instance and play. I think it would be nice if VRC_Pickup would have following ability: if object far away from it's spawn point for more that configurabe treshhold for more than configuable time it will be auto respawned. This also will help to restore obects that fall into hard-to-acess places on the map like corners or under the furniture.",
